<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Grant Opportunity Prompt Builder | Ironfeast Consulting</title>
<meta name="description" content="Build a research-grade AI prompt for finding grant opportunities — nonprofit or for-profit. A free tool from Ironfeast Consulting.">
<link rel="canonical" href="<%= siteBase %>/grant-builder">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600;700&display=swap">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f4f6fa;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --border: #dce2ee;
    --blue: #2563eb;
    --text: #1e2a3a;
    --muted: #52647a;
    --red: #dc2626;
    --serif: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
    --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
    --sans: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  /* ── Ironfeast site chrome (copied from index.ejs, namespaced) ── */
  .site-header {
    background-color: #2c3e50;
    color: #ecf0f1;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    font-family: var(--sans);
  }
  .site-nav-inner {
    max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px;
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;
  }
  .site-logo { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ecf0f1; text-decoration: none; line-height: 1.2; }
  .site-nav-links { display: flex; gap: 25px; list-style: none; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .site-nav-links a { text-decoration: none; color: #ecf0f1; font-weight: 500; transition: color .3s ease; }
  .site-nav-links a:hover, .site-nav-links a:focus-visible { color: #3498db; }
  .site-nav-links a[aria-current="page"] { color: #3498db; border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db; padding-bottom: 2px; }
  .site-footer {
    text-align: center; padding: 20px; background-color: #2c3e50;
    color: #ecf0f1; margin-top: auto; font-family: var(--sans);
  }

  /* ── Gate ── */
  .gate-wrap { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 48px 20px; }
  .gate {
    width: 100%; max-width: 560px; background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 40px 36px; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(30,42,58,0.06);
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .gate h1 { font-size: 1.85rem; line-height: 1.25; text-wrap: balance; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .gate h1 span { color: var(--blue); }
  .gate .lede { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .gate ul { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 26px; display: grid; gap: 9px; }
  .gate ul li { color: var(--muted); font-size: .95rem; padding-left: 26px; position: relative; line-height: 1.5; }
  .gate ul li::before {
    content: "→"; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;
    color: var(--blue); font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 700;
  }
  .field { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .field label {
    display: block; font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .field input {
    width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text); background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #c8d0e4; border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .field input:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--blue); outline-offset: 1px; border-color: var(--blue); }
  .hp { position: absolute; left: -9999px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; }
  .submit {
    width: 100%; margin-top: 8px; padding: 14px 20px;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff; background: var(--blue); border: none; border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer; transition: background-color .25s ease;
  }
  .submit:hover, .submit:focus-visible { background: #1d4ed8; }
  .error {
    background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; color: var(--red);
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .9rem; padding: 11px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .fineprint {
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .78rem; color: #a0afc0;
    text-align: center; margin-top: 16px; line-height: 1.5;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .site-nav-inner { justify-content: center; text-align: center; }
    .site-nav-links { gap: 16px; justify-content: center; }
    .site-logo { font-size: 1.45rem; }
    .gate { padding: 30px 22px; }
    .gate h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="site-nav-inner">
    <a href="<%= siteBase %>/" class="site-logo">Ironfeast Consulting</a>
    <nav aria-label="Main">
      <ul class="site-nav-links">
        <li><a href="<%= siteBase %>/#overview">Overview</a></li>
        <li><a href="<%= siteBase %>/#about">About Us</a></li>
        <li><a href="<%= siteBase %>/#sbir">SBIR Info</a></li>
        <li><a href="<%= siteBase %>/grant-builder" aria-current="page">Grant Builder</a></li>
        <li><a href="<%= siteBase %>/#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="gate-wrap">
  <div class="gate">
    <div class="eyebrow">Grant Intelligence &middot; v3.0</div>
    <h1>Grant Opportunity <span>Prompt Builder</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Answer a few questions about your organization and get a research-grade AI prompt
      built to surface grant opportunities you actually qualify for &mdash; ready to paste
      into any AI.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Role framing and chain-of-thought reasoning built in</li>
      <li>Hallucination controls, so it stops inventing funders</li>
      <li>Separate modes for for-profit and nonprofit applicants</li>
      <li>Free, and yours to reuse as often as you like</li>
    </ul>

    <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
      <p class="error" role="alert"><%= error %></p>
    <% } %>

    <form method="post" action="<%= siteBase %>/grant-builder" novalidate>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="name">Your name</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name"
               value="<%= typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.name ? values.name : '' %>" required>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="email">Work email</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email"
               value="<%= typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.email ? values.email : '' %>" required>
      </div>
      <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
        <label for="company_website">Leave this field empty</label>
        <input type="text" id="company_website" name="company_website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="submit">Open the builder</button>
    </form>

    <p class="fineprint">
      We will email you a copy of the link. No spam, and we will not share your address.
    </p>
  </div>
</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <p>&copy; 2026 Ironfeast Consulting. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
